    "advancement": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Beginning at 10th level, you gain the ability to pass through short distances in the blink of an eye. You may spend 1 fel points when you take the Attack action on your turn. Until the end of your turn, you can teleport up to 15 feet before each attack to an unoccupied space you can see.</p><p>If you attack at least two different creatures with during your Attack action, you can make one additional attack with it against a third creature.</p>",
